  "problem": "Mia won some money in the lottery and is now spending it. The amount of money $M$ in her bank account decreases at a rate that's proportional to the square of the time $t,$ in days, since she won.\nWhat differential equation describes the rate of change of the amount of money $M$ at time $t?$",
